target: internal/gather/gather.go
verify: go test ./internal/gather/ -count=1 -run 'TestAGoModuleIsDetected'
expect: --- FAIL: TestAGoModuleIsDetected/go.mod_over_a_Makefile
why:    the Makefile fallback outranks go.mod, so a Go module with a test target answers `make test` where a Cargo crate with one answers `cargo test`: two manifests ranked two ways.
--- old
	case exists("go.mod"):
		// Not in context.sh
--- new
	case exists("go.mod") && !exists("Makefile"):
		// Not in context.sh
